# dotenv environment variable files.
#
# `.env*` covers every variant, including `.env.production` — which was tracked
# before this rule existed. git ignores .gitignore for already-tracked files, so
# that one also had to be removed from the index with `git rm --cached`.
.env*
!.env.example

